# Tenant-Branded Certificate Generation Implementation Plan

We are implementing a professional, automated certificate generation system that is fully customizable by each tenant. Administrators will be able to upload their own branding (logos, signatures) and set brand colors, which will be dynamically reflected in the generated certificates.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - **Branding Assets**: Tenant admins will need a way to upload logos (PNG/JPG) and signatures. I'll implement a dedicated "Branding Settings" page for this.
> - **PDF Library**: I'll use `barryvdh/laravel-dompdf` for the backend. It's robust and supports CSS-based layouts.
> - **Issuance Criteria**: To ensure integrity, certificates will only be "claimable" if:
>   1. Course progress is 100%.
>   2. The final assessment is marked as `passed`.

